{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bEcF8KwtJl1795861232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[21:02]</p><p>屯門華運工業大廈有棚架起火，消防處初步相信起火原因與煙頭有關。</p><p></p><p>【早前報道】</p><p>屯門華運工業大廈有棚架起火，無人受傷，期間逾200人疏散。火警中有大片棚網燒毀，有街坊擔心其阻燃效能。</p><p></p><p>網上片段見到，大廈中層單位內，冒出熊熊火光。有竹棚和棚網被燒著，大量濃煙升上半空，有火舌從高處跌落。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1830-1_CLEAN_20261128_181721_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026V5e2dUCL2E1795861219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是屯門建發里2號，華運工業大廈。另一個角度看，有大片棚網被燒毀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1830-1_CLEAN_20261128_181721.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NZldEyGCuc1795861205.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防和警方下午約2時，接獲多人報案，懷疑大廈內一間洗衣房起火。消防到場撲救，至2時40分將火救熄。火警無人受傷，工廈內逾200人自行疏散。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-18h45m15s567.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VMgO1InpoP1795862776.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>工廈員工說：「我同事看到外面有火，我們已經逃生。有些同事拿滅火器，去噴外面的火。」</p><p></p><p>起火的華運工業大廈樓齡約47年，有多層的單位用作洗衣房。有街坊指大廈最近一年，正進行翻新工程，早前更換過棚網。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-18h45m38s642.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NrcSr6Q1Je1795862792.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黃先生說：「如果有阻燃，應該不會燒成這個樣子。」</p><p></p><p>火勢救熄後，多個政府部門，包括屋宇署、警方和消防等都分別派人進入大廈調查。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-18h45m29s226.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TLFHIAsUBK1795862828.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>大埔宏福苑去年發生火災後，政府去年底起要求棚網先做測試才能上架，確保阻燃。截至本月15日，屋宇署收到近1,100張防護物料上架的通知書，涵蓋約1,150幢樓宇。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T13:39:30.334883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":496,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:42.194837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:42.194837+00:00","content_hash":"34cae105b97c69383349b28272614a490a7ddf708bebf05050a07acffe30bbef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}